<item><title>Sirleaf warns Liberia’s peace faces risks without unity and inclusion</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/sirleaf-warns-liberia-s-peace-faces-risks-without-unity-and-80fb59/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/sirleaf-warns-liberia-s-peace-faces-risks-without-unity-and-80fb59/</guid><category>Liberia</category><description>The former president said 23 years without war could be undone if leaders fail to provide equal opportunity, as opposition figures face prosecutions.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:45:45 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" length="31000" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Liberia&apos;s Justice Ministry misses court deadline to free vessel and seven crew</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-s-justice-ministry-misses-court-deadline-to-free-fa848c/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-s-justice-ministry-misses-court-deadline-to-free-fa848c/</guid><category>Liberia</category><description>A judge ordered the IB Atlantic IV and its seven crew released by 4 p.m. Wednesday, but they were still in state custody that evening.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:09:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" length="31000" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Liberia launches its first written foreign policy</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-launches-its-first-written-foreign-policy-c1b9e6/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-launches-its-first-written-foreign-policy-c1b9e6/</guid><category>Liberia</category><description>The document includes a gender-responsive policy that the government says is Africa’s first formally adopted and launched written version.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:06:20 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" length="31000" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Liberia sets six priorities for December Security Council presidency</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-sets-six-priorities-for-december-security-council-294a4f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-sets-six-priorities-for-december-security-council-294a4f/</guid><category>Liberia</category><description>At a Cairo briefing, Ambassador Henry B. Fahnbulleh laid out the agenda, from youth and women&apos;s roles in peace to reform of the council itself.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:26:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" length="31000" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/lr.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Liberia records 2,900 new HIV infections and 1,400 AIDS deaths in 2025</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-records-2-900-new-hiv-infections-and-1-400-aids-cdd110/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-records-2-900-new-hiv-infections-and-1-400-aids-cdd110/</guid><category>Liberia</category><description>National AIDS Commission chair Cecelia Nutah said about 56,000 people are living with HIV, most of them women.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:14:23 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-records-2-900-new-hiv-infections-and-1-400-aids-cdd110/share.jpg" length="44467" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/lr/liberia-records-2-900-new-hiv-infections-and-1-400-aids-cdd110/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
